[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089344530","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108690#issuecomment-3089344530","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108690","id":3089344530,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64I6gS","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-18T12:34:13Z","updated_at":"2025-07-18T12:47:19Z","body":"There seems to be no problem. You may have got the coordinates wrong. \n\nRect2(x, y, width, height) \n\n```diff\n- Rect2(256, 0, 64, 64)\n+ Rect2(0, 256, 64, 64)\n```\n\nThat is, the horizontal is x and the vertical is y.\n\n```gdscript\nstatic func get_armor_icon_region(_t: Type, tier: int) -> Rect2i:\n\tvar column = int(_t) # tier\n\tvar row = tier # int(_t)\n\n\tvar pos = Vector2i(column * ICON_SIZE.x, row * ICON_SIZE.y)\n\n\treturn Rect2i(pos, ICON_SIZE)\n```\n\nYour calculations are reversed.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3089344530/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]